HOW IT WAS LEARNED
How the OP-1's hardware switches its USB port into host mode and powers it was worked out from the stock R246
firmware and by studying how Opus (LizardMan's OP-1 firmware mod) does it on the same hardware. The code in this
plugin is written from that understanding; it contains no code from Opus.

The plugin (bifrost.c, bf_usb.c, bf_usb.h, usb_desc.h, plugin.json) is built and packed with tools/pack-plugin.sh
against the Hundekraft 3.3.2 source; see the project README.
